🧱 Project Overview: “Notes App” with Auth + Roles
👤 User Features:
    Register/Login

    Create/Edit/Delete their own notes

    View only their own notes

    Search other users’ public notes (optional feature)

🛡 Admin Features:
    View all users

    View all notes (even private ones)

    Delete any note

🔧 Tech Stack Suggestion
    Backend: NestJS + PostgreSQL + TypeORM/Prisma

    Frontend: React (or Next.js if you want SSR)

    Auth: JWT with Role-based Access Control (RBAC)

    Database Models:

    User: id, email, hashed password, role (USER | ADMIN)

    Note: id, content, ownerId (FK to User), maybe isPublic

🔐 Permissions Logic
    Role	Can see own notes	Can search others’ notes	Can see all notes	Can delete any note
    User	✅	                ✅ (maybe optional)	        ❌	                 ❌
    Admin	✅	                ✅	                        ✅	                 ✅
    
🛠 Suggested Build Steps:
    NestJS Backend

    Auth module with JWT

    User module (CRUD)

    Notes module (CRUD)

    AuthGuard + RolesGuard

    Connect to Postgres

    Dockerize it

    React Frontend

    Login/Register

    Notes dashboard

    Admin panel

    Docker Compose full app